 {"id":"2efe9af2-ee9f-48fc-8605-96c8f738b5e6","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","client_id":null,"title":"Horror Dark Documentary","description":"For this kind of video, I want the edit to feel like:\nA disturbing medical mystery\nRural isolation\nArchival evidence\nA normal food becoming dangerous\nQuiet horror\nSerious documentary storytelling\nOpening retention requirement\n\n\n\nThe first 15 seconds are very important.\n\n\n\nWhat I do NOT want\n\n\n\nPlease do not apply if your editing style is mostly:\n\n\n\nRandom stock footage montage\nFast flashy transitions\nOveruse of effects\nBright modern grading\nGeneric faceless YouTube documentary style\nLoud trailer music\nJump scares\nAI visuals that look fake, glossy, or fantasy-like\nText everywhere\nClips that do not match the narration\nDeliverables\n\n\n\nFor each video, I need:\n\n\n\nFull edited YouTube video\n1080p or 4K export\nClean sound mix\nBackground music and sound effects included\nProject file if possible\nSource links for footage/images when available","created_at":"2026-07-02T06:25:05.30513+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-02T06:25:05.30513+00:00","managed_client_id":"08998573-cd5c-45b9-9de8-37e3b17a9269"}, 
