 {"id":"d30deffe-dedc-40dd-aeb4-f077d2217500","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Harun Video 5","description":"&lt;p&gt;Here is the first video, audio, and script: &lt;a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UCc8-gMXdpBKnkL1Ue9LcHiwPMmerhXyMm0bLk8bWmg/edit?usp=sharing\"&gt;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1UCc8-gMXdpBKnkL1Ue9LcHiwPMmerhXyMm0bLk8bWmg/edit?usp=sharing&lt;/a&gt;. Remove the audio pauses and add multiple like and subscribe CTAs. And the other stuff we just talked about. Here is the AI avatar part: &lt;a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tiMK6BJE7tn7o5fFzGA3KQw8uSHZku0g/view?usp=drive_link\"&gt;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tiMK6BJE7tn7o5fFzGA3KQw8uSHZku0g/view?usp=drive_link&lt;/a&gt;. Please match it with the voiceover again, don't use the voiceover from the AI avatar clip. Since, in some parts, the AI avatar looks a bit weird and unrealistic, avoid those parts and use it in the best parts. Again, remember to avoid low-quality images and videos. Copy the editing style of the channel I sent.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"review","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-29T19:00:00+00:00","budget":null,"created_at":"2026-07-30T03:56:22.919134+00:00","updated_at":"2026-08-01T21:13:04.126264+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"0b50250d-b43e-4001-a9fd-6474a3541494","managed_client_id":"d59f6872-7bf8-4935-a6ae-ba7f2ecf999d"}, 
 {"id":"57432a8c-a389-4ca0-bbf6-eae8e833480e","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Harun Video 1","description":"&lt;p&gt;Here is the whole script and audio: &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Lv8iGVRrbZOhWCxhKQ-GPIhKuXGhGpEBLjY1kRUWf0g/edit?usp=sharing.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I've already uploaded the avatar part. Just use it in the intro. Please fix the mistakes I pointed out. Remove audio pauses and add multiple like and subscribe CTAs throughout the video. Add matching copyright-free footage, and if using nanobanana, remove the watermark.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"archived","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-06-26T19:00:00+00:00","budget":12.00,"created_at":"2026-06-25T15:55:42.15156+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:52:27.535547+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6jZ7ib2Edes\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cVotLLx5bNs\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aZ0Y5mrXmoo","container_id":"0b50250d-b43e-4001-a9fd-6474a3541494","managed_client_id":"d59f6872-7bf8-4935-a6ae-ba7f2ecf999d"}, 
