 {"id":"f54cbd6d-32b4-459b-99bd-a0b33d470401","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Harun Video 2","description":"&lt;p&gt;Here is the next video, audio, and script: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Lv8iGVRrbZOhWCxhKQ-GPIhKuXGhGpEBLjY1kRUWf0g/edit?usp=sharing. Here is the AI avatar: Remove the audio pauses and add multiple like and subscribe CTAs. And the other stuff we just talked about. Here is the AI avatar part: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JCne-aAjnXLRtZg4YLRo7WxJsTiE-QVY/view?usp=sharing. Please match it with the voiceover again, don't use the voiceover from the AI avatar clip. Since, in some parts, the AI avatar looks a bit weird and unrealistic, avoid those parts and use it in the best parts. It is around 2 minutes long so use it in the intro. In the part in the intro where he says \"My name is Levi Miller...\" make sure you use that part since it fits to show his face when he starts introducing himself.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Well, the things I said. A bit more footage changes later on in the video, some clips you keep for 10 seconds, and they don't match all the sentences in those 10 seconds, so more clips change, a bit more text animation or effects, so it is not just a video slideshow. Add multiple like and subscribe CTAs, greenscreen overlays, remove audio pauses, maybe some sound effects, and that is all. Nothing too complicated, just a bit more effort.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"archived","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-06-30T19:00:00+00:00","budget":12.00,"created_at":"2026-06-29T02:54:40.71957+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:52:26.703221+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"0b50250d-b43e-4001-a9fd-6474a3541494","managed_client_id":"d59f6872-7bf8-4935-a6ae-ba7f2ecf999d"}, 
 {"id":"7cb753d1-a41b-4922-a6f4-739501b9c03e","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Harun Video 4","description":"&lt;p&gt;Here is the next video, audio, and script: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Lv8iGVRrbZOhWCxhKQ-GPIhKuXGhGpEBLjY1kRUWf0g/edit?usp=sharing. Remove the audio pauses and add multiple like and subscribe CTAs. And the other stuff we just talked about. Here is the AI avatar part: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1bFd3NIaU01-WD_H-L2_I6D4Rv0bavjax/view?usp=sharing. Please match it with the voiceover again, don't use the voiceover from the AI avatar clip. Since, in some parts, the AI avatar looks a bit weird and unrealistic, avoid those parts and use it in the best parts. Again, remember to avoid low-quality images and videos.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"archived","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-06T19:00:00+00:00","budget":null,"created_at":"2026-07-06T07:47:38.111036+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:52:50.231677+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"0b50250d-b43e-4001-a9fd-6474a3541494","managed_client_id":"d59f6872-7bf8-4935-a6ae-ba7f2ecf999d"}, 
