 {"id":"36d5cfd6-e5a8-4803-8fea-281228024ac3","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Harun Video 3","description":"&lt;p&gt;Here is the next video, audio, and script: &lt;strong&gt;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Lv8iGVRrbZOhWCxhKQ-GPIhKuXGhGpEBLjY1kRUWf0g/edit?usp=sharing.&lt;/strong&gt; Remove the audio pauses and add multiple like and subscribe CTAs. And the other stuff we just talked about. Here is the AI avatar part: &lt;strong&gt;https://drive.google.com/file/d/14OqVqc4RINHgEBKOmowvGLMI7bhQK4wq/view?usp=sharing.&lt;/strong&gt; Please match it with the voiceover again, don't use the voiceover from the AI avatar clip. Since, in some parts, the AI avatar looks a bit weird and unrealistic, avoid those parts and use it in the best parts. It is around 2 minutes long, so use it in the intro.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"archived","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-03T19:00:00+00:00","budget":null,"created_at":"2026-07-01T19:16:46.431287+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:52:57.450704+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"0b50250d-b43e-4001-a9fd-6474a3541494","managed_client_id":"d59f6872-7bf8-4935-a6ae-ba7f2ecf999d"}, 
 {"id":"e49d2ce9-40ad-48e4-8ed2-2c14eb99806a","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Mack Video 12","description":"&lt;p&gt;https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zrBLGL3oad0KImf98WtSaAS2g-bBQ4de?usp=drive_link&lt;/p&gt;","status":"done","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-07T19:00:00+00:00","budget":34.00,"created_at":"2026-07-07T04:23:53.708003+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:55:02.334505+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":"2026-07-18T05:55:02.334505+00:00","reference_links":null,"container_id":"a8baf896-777e-4bca-a451-b0bfe75bad7d","managed_client_id":"2015c089-44f4-4a3c-9ef0-d88d7a33202a"}, 
 {"id":"66a61243-4adb-4ef3-b6ff-f4bf8b2a8684","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Christaugonus Video 1","description":"&lt;p&gt;This video is about Stalinon, a French over-the-counter drug from 1954 that was sold for minor skin infections like acne and boils, but ended up causing brain swelling, blindness, convulsions, death, and permanent damage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The style should be Scary Interesting-inspired: slow dread, archival case-file feeling, dark still images, subtle zoom-ins/zoom-outs, restrained music, and simple text beats.&lt;br&gt;Visual style&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use mostly:&lt;br&gt;Vintage 1950s pharmacy stills&lt;br&gt;Old French street/pharmacy visuals&lt;br&gt;Macro shots of capsules and glass bottles&lt;br&gt;Medical documents / forms / approval stamps&lt;br&gt;Dark archival-style AI recreations where real visuals do not exist&lt;br&gt;Slow zooms on still photos&lt;br&gt;Subtle parallax on documents and pills&lt;br&gt;Black-screen pauses before major reveals&lt;br&gt;Minimal maps/location cards&lt;br&gt;Dark color grade, film grain, vignette, faint amber highlights&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Music and sound&lt;br&gt;Use tense background music similar to Scary Interesting:&lt;br&gt;Low ambient drone&lt;br&gt;Quiet suspense bed&lt;br&gt;Minimal pulses&lt;br&gt;Subtle risers before reveals&lt;br&gt;Near-silence after disturbing lines&lt;br&gt;No trailer music&lt;br&gt;No loud horror stingers&lt;br&gt;No flashy sound effects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Most important scenes to emphasize&lt;br&gt;The public trusted pills after the rise of antibiotics and modern medicine.&lt;br&gt;Stalinon was approved under a weak system called the Visa.&lt;br&gt;The drug contained a deadly impurity.&lt;br&gt;Capsules were inconsistently manufactured.&lt;br&gt;The capsules darkened as they became more toxic.&lt;br&gt;Instead of stopping sales, the visible warning was allegedly hidden with coloring.&lt;br&gt;Patients developed headaches, blindness, convulsions, coma, and brain swelling.&lt;br&gt;A doctor finally connected the cases to the same capsule.&lt;br&gt;The scandal helped change French drug safety law.&lt;br&gt;Tone&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This should feel like:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a pharmacy shelf turned into a crime scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Not flashy. Not fast. Not over-edited. Slow, clinical, cold, and disturbing.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Make sure to use multiple different background music as pace of script or dramatic point.&lt;/p&gt;","status":"paid","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-04T19:00:00+00:00","budget":42.00,"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:26:54.079715+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:55:05.420214+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"2efe9af2-ee9f-48fc-8605-96c8f738b5e6","managed_client_id":"08998573-cd5c-45b9-9de8-37e3b17a9269"}, 
 {"id":"ffba7375-b7e4-4b30-9592-b9fc9d79d95b","agency_id":"b67bb03f-bcf1-419e-83a2-224964147e34","title":"Christaugonus Video 2","description":"&lt;p&gt;full shot-by-shot PDF with per-shot timecodes at 6–10s granularity across the 9:27 runtime. you can use epidemic sound cos I am subscribed to it&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;","status":"paid","client_id":null,"due_date":"2026-07-12T19:00:00+00:00","budget":null,"created_at":"2026-07-11T09:10:14.270952+00:00","updated_at":"2026-07-18T05:55:12.056954+00:00","editor_rate":null,"completed_at":null,"reference_links":null,"container_id":"2efe9af2-ee9f-48fc-8605-96c8f738b5e6","managed_client_id":"08998573-cd5c-45b9-9de8-37e3b17a9269"}, 
